    "Description": "The OpenJDK 21 packages provide the OpenJDK 21 Java Runtime Environment and the OpenJDK 21 Java Software Development Kit.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* JDK: Enhance Path Factories (CVE-2025-53066)\n\n* JDK: Enhance Certificate Handling (CVE-2025-53057)\n\n* JDK: Enhance String Handling (CVE-2025-61748)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
